{"c":[{"id":"ad4caf8a4e44a08e","sum":"PR #55: zoom pack map by node.name; catalog treats git-visible /.summem/ paths as started stores. drop-dataclasses: slots + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random/argparse; version/init/-h skip those; 3.14 traces driver __import__","tree":{"c":[{"id":"ee4b855f3bb41c18","sum":"PR #55 zoom pack map by node.name; catalog treats git-visible /.summem/ paths as started stores, not only config.toml","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T202720Z-e2156bfaebf2808e","text":"PR #55 review: zoom pack map keyed by node.name so a shared content id prints the first list_view row; _index_tree inside loads_tree try so unprojectable children skip like other unreadable packs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T202837Z-054930bcd901bdc3","text":"Root catalog treats any git-visible path under /.summem/ as a started store, not only config.toml; file-level ignore of config.toml cannot hide a store that has notes.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ba93ada09ab368a1","sum":"drop-dataclasses: slots + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random/argparse; version/init/-h skip those imports; 3.14 isolation traces driver __import__, not fcntl absent from sys.modules","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T203211Z-4806c48701ff1fd1","text":"Issue #52 L2 drop-dataclasses: slots for five types + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random; version/init/help must not import those three; 3.11 gate stays after import sys; argparse leftover optional","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T204312Z-499edef570adadd5","text":"3.14 pathlib imports fcntl; startup isolation tests must trace the driver's __import__, not assert fcntl absent from sys.modules","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cf60f219a2792389","sum":"drop-dataclasses: slots + lazy imports, 3.14 traces driver imports; perf-shards #49-52 shipped, #53 deferred; same-leaf-set conflicts take one side's .summem paths; wake never drops nodes to fit WAKE_LINES.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"487ebdfd573e5b55","sum":"drop-dataclasses archived: slots + lazy imports; py3.14 startup traces driver imports. perf-shards L4 archived: #49-52 merged via #54-57; #53 deferred (heal ~1ms, stem-hash cannot skip note).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T204853Z-9fffd75ba86574c8","text":"drop-dataclasses archived: slots + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random/argparse; version/init/-h skip those imports; 3.14 isolation traces driver __import__; memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260825-drop-dataclasses.md","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T213440Z-4f6d26cb15712799","text":"perf-shards L4 archived to memory-bank/archive/systems/20260825-perf-shards.md; #49–#52 merged as #54–#57; #53 won't-do-YET (leftover heal ~1ms; stem-hash cannot skip note).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b8d0c71e201b6a9e","sum":"Conflicting same-leaf-set naps: take every .summem path from one side; wake never drops view nodes to fit WAKE_LINES — over-budget lists all until note/nap fold.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T213542Z-65041798fe3dbbfa","text":"Same leaf-set id with different nested captions add/add-conflicts both .tree and .summ; never mismatch a stem; take every conflicting .summem path from one side (#59).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T221202Z-91f4493afe6aed99","text":"Wake never drops view nodes to fit WAKE_LINES; over-budget (including 0) lists every node; note/nap fold the count back.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
